allback","text":"For hundreds of years, St.Bernard dogs have saved the lives of travellers crossing the dangerous Pass.","start":37.48,"end":43.95,"score":0.977,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-006","sourceId":"b3-008-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"These friendly dogs, which were first brought from Asia, were used as watchdogs even in Roman times.","start":45.08,"end":52.45,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-007-p01","sourceId":"b3-008-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Now that a tunnel has been built through the mountains, the Pass is less dangerous,","start":53.41,"end":58.07,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-007-p02","sourceId":"b3-008-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[15,33],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"but each year, the dogs are still sent out into the snow whenever a traveller is in difficulty.","start":58.92,"end":65.25,"score":0.964,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-008","sourceId":"b3-008-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Despite the new tunnel, there are still a few people who rashly attempt to cross the Pass on foot.","start":66.16,"end":72.46,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-009","sourceId":"b3-008-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"During the summer months, the monastery is very busy, for it is visited by thousands of people who cross the Pass in cars.","start":74.15,"end":82.95,"score":0.967,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-010","sourceId":"b3-008-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"As there are so many people about, the dogs have to be kept in a special enclosure.","start":84.2,"end":89.5,"score":0.993,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-011","sourceId":"b3-008-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In winter, however, life at the monastery is quite different.","start":90.24,"end":94.32,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-012","sourceId":"b3-008-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"The temperature drops to -30 degrees, and very few people attempt to cross the Pass.","start":95.02,"end":101.65,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-013","sourceId":"b3-008-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The monks prefer winter to summer for they have more privacy.","start":102.8,"end":106.95,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-014","sourceId":"b3-008-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The dogs have greater freedom, too, for they are allowed to wander outside their enclosure.","start":107.74,"end":113.35,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-015","sourceId":"b3-008-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"The only regular visitors to the monastery in winter are parties of skiers who go there at Christmas and Easter.","start":114.28,"end":121.64,"score":0.975,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-008-016","sourceId":"b3-008-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"These young people, who love the peace of the mountains, always receive a warm welcome at St.Bernard's monastery.","start":122.77,"end":130.38,"score":0.956,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
